{"title":"o3 and AGI, is April 16th AGI day?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916794437/0/marginalrevolution~o-and-AGI-is-April-th-AGI-day.html","date":1744823691000,"content":"<p>I think it is AGI, seriously.  Try asking it lots of questions, and then ask yourself: just how much smarter was I expecting AGI to be?</p>\r\n<p>As I’ve argued in the past, AGI, however you define it, is not much of a social event per se.  It still will take us a long time to use it properly.  I do not expect securities prices to move significantly (that AI is progressing rapidly already is priced in, and I doubt if the market cares about “April 16th” per se).</p>\r\n<p>Benchmarks, benchmarks, blah blah blah.  Maybe AGI is like porn — I know it when I see it.</p>\r\n<p>And I’ve seen it.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sq8GBPUb3rk\" target=\"_blank\">the OpenAI LiveStream</a>.  And they tell us o3 pro is on the way.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/danshipper/status/1912551847056785841\" target=\"_blank\">a good Dan Shipper review</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1912555697193275511\" target=\"_blank\">Alexandr Wang</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/o3-and-agi-is-april-16th-agi-day.html\">o3 and AGI, is April 16th AGI day?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/916794437/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/916794437/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feed